Package: papers
Version: @DEB_PAPERS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/papers
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libpoppler-glib8, libexempi8, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libcairo2, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dbus
Description: Papers, the GTK4 GNOME document (PDF) viewer
 Papers is the GTK4/libadwaita successor to Evince. Built PDF-only against
 poppler-glib. Runs as a plain X11/Wayland client under any window manager.
